'''''Star Wars: Target Vader''''' is a [[Marvel Comics]] miniseries focusing on the character [[Beilert Valance]] during his time as a [[bounty hunter]]. The series is written by [[Robbie Thompson]]<ref name="Celebration panel" /> with art by [[Marc Laming]] and was published starting July [[2019]].

